    TITLE
    LOAD
    PLAY
    PAUSE
    DIALOGUE
    CHARACTER
    DEBUG
    GAME_OVER
    TRADE
    SAVE
  }
}

note right of GameState
  - ゲームの状態を表す列挙型（タイトル、ロード、プレイ等）
  - Enum representing game states (title, load, play, etc.)
